Write a query that prints a list of employee names (i.e.: the name attribute) from the Employee table in alphabetical order.

              Employee
------------------------------------
        FIELD    |     TYPE
------------------------------------
    Employee_ID  |     Integer
------------------------------------
       Name      |     String
------------------------------------
      Months     |     Integer
------------------------------------
      Salary     |     Integer

Solution:

SELECT Name
FROM Employee
ORDER BY Name ASC;
